{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/09/0287298/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/09/0287298/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分を占ってみました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/09/0287298/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではちょっとその結果見てください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/09/0287298/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『異性から見た貴方の印象は？』\n★声が素敵\n★笑顔が最高\n★教養がある\n★顔がイケてる\n★仕事が出来る\n★絡みやすい\n★キラキラしている\n★興味深い\n★無敵\n★セクシー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の感想\nまぁまぁまぁ確かにっ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/09/0287298/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部あったますよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/09/0287298/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"苦笑\nってのは嘘で、少しこの占いうたがいましたよ...？苦笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『見た目と違って実は〇〇〇な女』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★実はすぐ騙されやすい女"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の感想\nえっ！？ほんまでっか？わぁお"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/09/0287298/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"∋∀∈あちゃぁ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/09/0287298/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『貴方の告白の仕方』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★好きでござる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の感想\nイヤイヤイヤイヤ\n『ござる』使わないから"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/09/0287298/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁ今日友達に\n『好きでござる』\nって言ったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/09/0287298/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(真顔で)\nそしたら\n『占いの影響やなっ』って言われた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/09/0287298/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってのはまぁどーでもいい話ですね..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/09/0287298/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"苦笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『貴方の死亡予告書』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★2017年2月3日17時40分30秒\nアラスカで覗き中に熊と間違えられ射殺され......(*_*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の感想\nあと四年後？18才だ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/09/0287298/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(^_^;)わぁおっ！ほんまでっか！？笑\nまぁまず何を覗いてたの？\nってゆーねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/09/0287298/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気を付けますわ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/09/0287298/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/09/0287298/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},